  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 408.17 River Herring. The Connecticut River and tributaries shall be closed to the taking of alewife (Alosa pseudoharengus) and blueback herring (Alosa aestivalis).\n\nSource. #10936, eff 1-1-16",
